==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɪtəɹəsi/}}
* {{audio|en-us-literacy.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
'''literacy'''

# the [[ability]] to process and produce material in a variety of forms including, but not limited to written, oral, visual, and digital.
# [[understanding]] of something (ex. [[computer]] literacy)

